        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Way of the Samurai is forged in battle!\nPlay as a ronin during Japan's Meiji Restoration in the volatile Rokkotsu Pass. The swordsmith Dojima falls into debt and his beautiful daughter is taken as collateral. Help repay the debt by crafting swords by day and exploring the mysterious, twisting dungeons of the Ipponmatsu Cave for valuable materials at night.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡El Camino del Samurái se forja en la batalla! Juega como ronin durante la Restauración Meiji de Japón, en el volátil paso de Rokkotsu. El herrero Dojima cae en deudas y su hermosa hija es tomada como garantía. Ayuda a saldar la deuda forjando espadas de día y explorando de noche las misteriosas y sinuosas mazmorras de la cueva Ipponmatsu en busca de materiales valiosos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2020",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
